{"ID":"20240506105107-joms1f1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240506105107-joms1f1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506105107-joms1f1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506105107-knvndpr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613150108-6ttbn0t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1420,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613150107-4w5vi7a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"327药实根","updated":"20240702163546"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240702163543-zrlu1ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702163543-zrlu1ha","updated":"20240702163546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240613145803-wzt2dvl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145803-wzt2dvl"}},{"ID":"20240613145836-hbi3otl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145836-hbi3otl","updated":"20240613145841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145836-8cfancw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145836-8cfancw","updated":"20240613145836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145836-bns6sb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145836-bns6sb8","updated":"20240613145836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主邪气，诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。一名连木。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145836-g08g7o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145836-g08g7o7","updated":"20240613145836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生蜀郡，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145836-uis8zeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145836-uis8zeu","updated":"20240613145836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：贝父，药实也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145846-bkzkkzb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145846-bkzkkzb"}},{"ID":"20240613145847-0obvglz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145847-0obvglz","updated":"20240613145851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145847-5xg8bih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145847-5xg8bih","updated":"20240613145847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主邪气，诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。一名连木。生蜀郡山谷，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145803-3ww9zja","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145803-3ww9zja"}},{"ID":"20240613145827-vvj4o0g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145827-vvj4o0g","updated":"20240613145830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145827-4z68bqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145827-4z68bqp","updated":"20240613145827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主邪气，诸痹，疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。一名连木。生蜀郡山谷。采无〔谨案〕此药子也，当今盛用，胡名那绽，出通州、渝州。《本经》用根，恐误载根字。子味辛，平，无毒。主破血，止利，消肿，除蛊注蛇毒。树生叶似杏，花红白色，子肉味酸甘。用其核仁也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145803-uuux959","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145803-uuux959"}},{"ID":"20240613145818-tbl2mbd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145818-tbl2mbd","updated":"20240613145822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145818-zw1jrae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145818-zw1jrae","updated":"20240613145818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、温，无毒。主寒湿邪气，诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。子主破血、止痢，消肿，除蛊疰、蛇毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145856-6smf6wf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145856-6smf6wf"}},{"ID":"20240613145857-2cl7wuv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145857-2cl7wuv","updated":"20240613145901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145857-wg2313u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145857-wg2313u","updated":"20240613145857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．生蜀郡，采无时．"}]},{"ID":"20240613145857-zchb948","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145857-zchb948","updated":"20240613145857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶药实根，味辛，温．主邪气诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓．一名连木．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240613145907-s7wk92a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145907-s7wk92a"}},{"ID":"20240613145908-ozpak35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145908-ozpak35","updated":"20240613145915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145908-0ogntbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145908-0ogntbg","updated":"20240613145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主邪气。诸痹疼酸。续绝伤。补骨髓。一名连木。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145908-3j0fkyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145908-3j0fkyu","updated":"20240613145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药纷诸子。木以连名。花同春发。实独秋成。绝者复续。亏以求盈。既消蛊疰。亦解蛇萦。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145908-oto8i70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145908-oto8i70","updated":"20240613145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉书志。诸子之言。纷然淆乱。苏颂曰。黄药子出岭南。秦州出者。红药子。施州出者赤药子。七月开白花。苏恭曰。开州出苦药子。皆相类。李时珍曰。药实子虽似黄药。苦药。微有不同。二药子不结子。此则树之子也。礼记疏。断者不可续。论衡。不嫌亏以求盈。苏盈曰。除蛊疰蛇毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145803-oiv8pzq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145803-oiv8pzq"}},{"ID":"20240613145805-7gir3es","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613145805-7gir3es","updated":"20240613145812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613145805-8wwk3wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145805-8wwk3wf","updated":"20240613145805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主邪气，诸痹疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。一名连木。生蜀郡山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145805-bxnh0dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145805-bxnh0dp","updated":"20240613145805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145805-qefluzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613145805-qefluzq","updated":"20240613145805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶此药子也，当今盛用，胡名那绽，出通州、渝州。《本经》用根。恐误载根字。子、味辛，平，无毒。主破血，止痢，消肿，除蛊疰蛇毒。树生，叶似杏，花红白色，子肉味酸、甘，用其核仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240613145806-k1iyicp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613145806-k1iyicp"}},{"ID":"20240613150005-chys2k5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613150005-chys2k5","updated":"20240613150012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄药根《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613150005-cemritb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613150005-cemritb","updated":"20240613150007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"黄药根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生岭南，今夔、峡州郡及明、越、秦、陇州山中亦有之，以忠、万州者为胜。藤生、高三、四尺；根及茎以小桑，十月采根。秦州出者谓之红药子，叶似荞麦，枝梗赤色，七月开白花，其根初采，湿时红赤色，曝干即黄。开州兴元府又产一种苦药子，大抵与黄药相类，主五脏邪气，治肺，压热，除烦燥，亦入马药用。春采根曝干。又下有药实根条，云生蜀郡山谷。苏恭云∶即药子也，用其核仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240613150043-ctav753","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613150043-ctav753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》误载根字，疑即黄药之实，然云生叶似杏，花红白色，子肉味酸，此为不同。今亦稀用，故附于此。孙思邈《千金月令》∶疗忽生瘿疾一、二年者，以万州黄药子半斤，须紧重者为上。如轻虚，即是佗州者，力慢，须用一倍。取无灰酒一斗，投药其中，固济瓶口，以糠火烧一复时，停腾，待酒冷即开。患者时时饮一盏，不令绝酒气。经三、五日后，常须把镜自照，觉销即停饮，不尔便令人项细也。刘禹锡《传信方》亦着其效，云得之邕州从事张 ， 目击有效，复己试，其验如神。其方并同，有小异处。惟烧酒侯香气出外，瓶头有津出即止，不待一宿，火仍不得太猛。酒有灰。"}]},{"ID":"20240613150005-c52m128","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613150005-c52m128"}},{"ID":"20240613150107-4w5vi7a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613150107-4w5vi7a","updated":"20240613150111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药实根《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613150107-6vkyn1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613150107-6vkyn1a","updated":"20240613150107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，无毒。主治邪气，诸痹，疼酸，续绝伤，补骨髓。一名连木。生蜀郡山谷。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240613150107-0adpvin","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613150107-0adpvin"}},{"ID":"20240613150108-6ttbn0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613150108-6ttbn0t"}}]}